Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.58,0:01:36.97,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,EPISODE 12: \NLIZE, THE BLACK WITCH'S APPRENTICE
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.64,0:01:35.03,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,Well, this is a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.27,0:01:38.36,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,I did not expect Henri to drop \Nin with Luna and her friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.08,0:01:40.70,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,I apologize for intruding,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.93,0:01:44.03,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,but this is the only truly \Nsafe place I could think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.34,0:01:48.43,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,I don't mind. We are protected \Nby a very strong barrier here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.84,0:01:49.91,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,Even the royal family
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.91,0:01:53.96,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,cannot communicate with us here, \Nnor enter without my permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.51,0:01:59.61,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,You made the best decision for \Nprotecting them. You have my thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.61,0:02:01.39,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,Um, I'm honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.61,0:02:08.15,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,By the way, Master Bird, about this... \Nofficial? This part-white magician?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.15,0:02:09.65,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,How do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.65,0:02:12.13,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,He is my blood relative.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.50,0:02:16.12,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,The same white magician \Nblood runs in our veins,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.12,0:02:20.16,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,but he has agreed to perform certain \Ntasks for the black magicians.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.41,0:02:26.91,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,He assists me in various ways, \Nas I live secretly as a black magician
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.91,0:02:29.42,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,inside the white witches' royal palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.17,0:02:34.93,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,We are both in precarious positions, \Nbut he performs his duties diligently.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.07,0:02:37.23,Italics,Luna (M),0,0,0,,Henri...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.85,0:02:42.97,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,As I cannot use magic, I don't think \NI've been particularly helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.97,0:02:45.39,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,But while I do not understand why,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.80,0:02:49.66,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,I have this nagging feeling that I can't \Nignore the plight of the black witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.28,0:02:54.13,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,Even if it puts my life at risk, I want \Nto do whatever I can to help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.73,0:02:58.65,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Huh, so that's what you're about.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.65,0:03:02.67,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Well, Master Bird himself is already \Nan anomaly as a white witch,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.67,0:03:04.91,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,so I guess this isn't any stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.46,0:03:09.66,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,This connection between \Nthem is suffocating me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.39,0:03:13.23,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Even if I try to look away, \NI can't help but see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.64,0:03:16.29,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I, on the contrary, \Nam weak enough to disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.68,0:03:22.18,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I sense such a strong bond between them...\N I don't want to see any more!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.15,0:03:27.09,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,By the way, Wind, were you able \Nto fulfill your duty regarding
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.09,0:03:29.55,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,The End of All Things without incident?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.87,0:03:30.31,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.81,0:03:40.08,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,I see. You shredded its poisoned \Nskin into smaller pieces
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.08,0:03:41.55,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,and scattered them everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.17,0:03:38.84,Default - Top,Gus,0,0,0,,Ouch! Ouch! Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.63,0:03:44.09,Default - Top,Gus,0,0,0,,There was nothing else I could do!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.50,0:03:48.37,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,It was pretty much a corpse \Nanyway, so what's the harm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.17,0:03:52.33,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Huh? Don't look at me like that, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.33,0:03:56.47,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,I see. So you spread the seeds \Nof The End even further.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.47,0:03:58.36,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,What an absolute catastrophe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.87,0:04:03.48,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,Breathing that air has clearly \Ntaken a toll on Lize, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.00,0:04:06.86,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I only spread a little bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.86,0:04:11.45,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I made sure to send all the rest to Flame \Nand Stoney with wind teleportation!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.16,0:04:13.10,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,POISON (END OF ALL THINGS) CLEANUP CREW
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.16,0:04:13.10,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,CRYSTAL WITCH | FLAME MAGICIAN
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.45,0:04:14.63,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I mean, you were all asking \Nway too much of me, anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.63,0:04:18.62,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Miss Luna, would you quit inventing \Nscary faces to glare at me with? Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.62,0:04:23.74,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Today is the first time I've met black \Nmagicians other than Miss Witch,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.74,0:04:25.70,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,but this Wind Magician...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.70,0:04:29.99,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,seems to have no problem at all\N flaunting ethical standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.74,0:04:26.31,Default - Top,Gus,0,0,0,,Wow! Look, now you're all doing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.31,0:04:29.99,Default - Top,Gus,0,0,0,,Come on, guys. Somebody \Nsay something! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.99,0:04:35.12,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,C'mon! Why're you all picking on me?! \NDo you know what I've been through?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.12,0:04:39.13,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,It isn't like Miss Luna and Master Bird \Nare doing poison collection-slash-cleanup!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.13,0:04:41.88,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Slaying The End of All Things \Nand hauling all that poison
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.88,0:04:44.51,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,REBEL WITHOUT A CAUSE
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.88,0:04:44.51,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,is super rough work and it's \Nscary and really stressful!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.61,0:04:44.51,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,ADULTS JUST DON'T UNDERSTAND
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.80,0:04:48.13,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I put my life on the line fighting \Na monster and you want me to be delicate?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.13,0:04:49.25,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Gimme a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.25,0:04:51.63,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,There's some things in life \Nyou just can't do perfectly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.63,0:04:56.91,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,But you all stand there judging me from \Na safe distance like you're above me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.91,0:04:59.23,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,That's not what we're cringing at, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.23,0:05:03.69,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Do you have a right to attack me just \N'cause I do things a little different?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.69,0:05:05.45,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,I suppose that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.45,0:05:09.47,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,Wind has a good point. Perhaps \Nwe should leave criticism
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.47,0:05:13.62,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,to the two in charge of disposing \Nof The End of All Things instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.83,0:05:11.77,Italics - Top,sfx,0,0,0,,Emotional abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.62,0:05:15.49,Italics - Top,sfx,0,0,0,,Emotional abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.05,0:05:18.83,Italics - Top,sfx,0,0,0,,Emotional abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.62,0:05:16.27,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,Surely they are in a better \Nposition to judge than we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.01,0:05:26.67,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I didn't realize black witches all \Ntake on different roles like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.00,0:05:28.97,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Like slaying The End of All Things...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.58,0:05:35.98,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,Master Bird, I should take my leave now. \NMy supervisor must be looking for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.98,0:05:39.61,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,Very well. Thank you for \Neverything. And be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.90,0:05:43.55,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,To be safe, I will cast a fake \Nshield over your memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.55,0:05:44.89,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.54,0:05:48.43,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,Well then, Luna,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.06,0:05:50.18,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.86,0:05:54.62,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,I very much enjoyed meeting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.05,0:05:59.38,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,I pray that I will find you again \Nsomeday, happy and healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.62,0:06:03.88,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Miss Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.77,0:06:10.01,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I'm real sorry for throwing a fit \Nlike that. But do you think...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.55,0:06:12.49,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,you could do your thing for me, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.77,0:06:16.17,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.31,0:06:24.07,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I've been too busy to \Ncome see you recently,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.07,0:06:26.62,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,so I'm sorry I let it get this bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:30.42,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,It's no trouble at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.77,0:06:49.96,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,You must have suffered greatly\N if you contracted this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.78,0:06:56.38,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,Poison magicians are much more \Ncapable of tolerating and coexisting
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.38,0:07:01.73,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,with poison than most, but that does not \Nmean they have total control over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.19,0:07:05.65,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,Luna is the exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.07,0:07:09.66,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,The rest must carry out their \Nduties tainted with poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.03,0:07:15.67,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,The poisonous mushrooms, of all \Ndifferent shapes and colors,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.02,0:07:19.58,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,almost resembled a cradle protecting Wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.18,0:07:23.15,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,and for a moment, appeared very beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.17,0:07:27.81,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for being so patronizing before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.81,0:07:29.97,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,I truly am grateful for all you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.47,0:07:31.99,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Then,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.99,0:07:36.44,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,as if they had been watching over Wind \Nas he slept in a great mushroom forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.91,0:07:40.86,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,the mushrooms floated up gently \Ninto the air and then disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.49,0:07:45.23,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Phew! I'm reborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.73,0:07:49.14,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,My body feels so light!\NIt feels like I grew wings!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.14,0:07:50.99,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Thanks, Miss Luna!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.99,0:07:53.99,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,I'm very glad that I was able to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.22,0:07:55.23,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.25,0:08:02.04,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoops. Whenever Miss Luna smiles \Nat me, I get this tingly feeling inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.04,0:08:06.86,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Miss Witch, can you cure any kind of \Nailment by turning it into a mushroom
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.86,0:08:08.09,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,and then removing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.57,0:08:11.96,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Sometimes, ailments are \Nbound to a person's destiny,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.37,0:08:16.04,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,so I can't turn just anything \Ninto a mushroom and take it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:21.10,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,In those cases, I can either \Nleave it there as an ailment
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.50,0:08:25.85,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,or try to force it out, but when \NI do that it comes at a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.34,0:08:27.64,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Price?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.11,0:08:34.11,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Now that the other guy left and we know \NMiss Luna's powers are back to normal,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.34,0:08:37.23,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,why don't you and I have a little chat?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.34,0:08:40.82,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,And then I'll make my decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.25,0:08:45.46,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,This is a final interview that will \Ndetermine if you pass or fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.76,0:08:52.15,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I think you know this by now, \Nbut a cursed youngling is basically an egg
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.15,0:08:53.89,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,that grows into The End of All Things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.49,0:08:58.26,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,So look, Lize, if this keeps up, you're \Ngonna turn into The End yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.73,0:09:18.53,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Lize? Lize!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.74,0:09:26.16,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I'm guessing that shocked face means\N nobody told you anything, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.46,0:09:31.01,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I'm sure they had their reasons not \Nto tell you the truth about all this,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.50,0:09:34.44,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,but we won't get anywhere \Nif you know nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.44,0:09:37.26,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,so I made the call to tell you myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.56,0:09:44.02,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I always suspected something. I didn't \Nwant to believe it was true, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.38,0:09:48.41,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,A cursed youngling is one destined \Nto become The End of All Things...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.41,0:09:52.85,Flashback_Italics,Queen,0,0,0,,You are the one who should \Nnever have been born.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.81,0:09:55.56,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.27,0:09:56.99,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.79,0:09:58.63,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.13,0:10:02.85,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Man, you're always sinking \Ninto darkness. What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.12,0:10:06.53,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Would you mind snapping outta \N that self-pity for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.53,0:10:07.77,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I've got a job to do here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.67,0:10:12.67,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,He has so little empathy and \Ncompassion, it's almost shocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.67,0:10:13.67,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.01,0:10:15.03,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.03,0:10:18.67,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,But right now, I think \Nthat's exactly what I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.60,0:10:18.17,Default - Top,Gus,0,0,0,,So listen, Lize,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.67,0:10:21.79,Default - Top,Gus,0,0,0,,you're totally, pointlessly head \Nover heels for Luna, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.79,0:10:23.77,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Ugh. Totally insensitive, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.77,0:10:26.18,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Wait. Did you think nobody noticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.18,0:10:29.82,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,You reek so badly of infatuation, \Neven a total idiot could tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.31,0:10:35.07,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,This isn't good. I can't spend all my \Ntime cataloging other people's faults.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.07,0:10:39.54,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,So have you also not realized what \Nkind of a spot that puts Miss Luna in?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.02,0:10:43.33,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I can't bear it. Talking to \Nthis guy is too frustrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.33,0:10:47.45,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,You're definitely hard-headed \Nenough to be a white witch, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.45,0:10:52.04,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,But look, you need to smother that \Ncrush of yours once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.58,0:10:54.95,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,It's never going to blossom, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.34,0:10:59.26,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I want you to tear it out while it's \Nstill a bud. You get me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.26,0:11:04.14,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,For black witches, love is a poison\N that weakens their magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.34,0:11:09.18,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,But like you just said, \Nisn't it completely one-sided?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.18,0:11:10.59,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.98,0:11:15.52,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,If your crush on her was \Nthe reason she was struggling,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.52,0:11:18.90,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,test or no test, I would \Nhave killed you on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.17,0:11:23.16,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,But the cause turned out to be another \Nperson, so you're off the hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.26,0:11:29.06,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,GLOOM
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.07,0:11:26.44,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Huh? Is that something \Nto get depressed about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.44,0:11:28.93,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,You sure love basking in doom and gloom!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.65,0:11:34.67,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Even then, even if it meant my \Ndeath, I wish it had been me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.67,0:11:40.61,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,GLOOM
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.67,0:11:39.46,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,But to be honest, there's another \Nreason I couldn't just kill you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.94,0:11:43.87,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Anyway, if you don't want to die, \Nyou need to strengthen your magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.87,0:11:45.58,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,and learn to stand on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.14,0:11:50.50,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,That is, if you wanna escape your fate \Nas a cursed youngling, like Miss Luna did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.10,0:11:54.26,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Maybe it was starting to drive me crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.17,0:12:00.99,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,When I found out she had been cursed \Njust like me, I thought it was fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.99,0:12:05.45,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,This joy I secretly felt \Nbecame a sliver of hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.87,0:12:11.10,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,This solitude that she could never \Nshare somehow both saved me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.10,0:12:12.79,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,and devastated me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.16,0:12:16.84,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Even while knowing that love \Nis poison for Miss Witch,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.84,0:12:19.85,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I dearly wish to become \Nthe one there to protect her
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.18,0:12:24.55,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,and to heal the wounds she \Ncarries. I want to be the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.89,0:12:29.10,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Even if I can't touch her,\N I want to stay by her side always.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.10,0:12:33.23,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,And even now, I can't \Nchange the way I feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.23,0:12:36.99,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,White witches are gross! \NEven after what I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.99,0:12:39.38,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,you're still getting off on \Nyour nasty little love poems?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.38,0:12:43.41,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,That's so egotistical... \Nit absolutely reeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.15,0:12:49.59,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Someone like you would never understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.96,0:12:54.18,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,A black magician who's never \Neven liked another person
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.18,0:12:58.04,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,wouldn't understand the first thing \Nabout the joy and pain of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.41,0:13:00.72,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,You force people's feelings \Ninto simplistic categories
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.72,0:13:03.55,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,and then try to knock them \Ndown and mock them one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.01,0:13:08.45,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Quit acting like you've figured me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.72,0:13:13.18,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,You're missing the point. \NAre you good, dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.61,0:13:17.90,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,You sure like to ramble, though. I mean, \Nit's fine if that burns off some poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.59,0:13:21.73,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,There is one thing I want to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.75,0:13:25.95,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Do you really think a life \Nwithout love is that terrible?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.49,0:13:27.45,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.45,0:13:33.06,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Would it make you feel incomplete as a \Nperson? Is it something to be ashamed of?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.40,0:13:34.45,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.70,0:13:38.59,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Do people who've never been \Nin love not even matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.40,0:13:40.92,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I don't know the answer to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.53,0:13:44.08,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,But I don't need to \Nhear you of all people,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.08,0:13:45.72,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,a kid who spends every day with Luna,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.26,0:13:49.66,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,trash talking people for not knowing love.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.61,0:13:55.29,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,She's unable to love for \Nreasons beyond her control.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.29,0:14:00.72,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,So what you're doing is like \Nselfishly backing her into a corner
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.72,0:14:04.90,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,and forcing her to accept bouquets of \Nthorny flowers that slice up her hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.26,0:14:12.40,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now{\i0} you decide to start crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.40,0:14:13.91,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Whoa, somethin' came outta that brooch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.46,0:14:17.59,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,When she's bound by so many chains
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.59,0:14:20.63,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,shackling her to a fate that allows her\N no freedom to begin with,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.63,0:14:26.34,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I can't keep clinging to my love \Nfor her like a selfish child.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.34,0:14:28.17,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I have no right to be with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.58,0:14:30.95,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.62,0:14:34.09,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.54,0:14:51.37,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Y'know, a long time ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.37,0:14:55.12,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,there was someone you could say \NI had something like a crush on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.59,0:14:56.31,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.68,0:14:58.62,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,What, is that so shocking?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.31,0:15:01.81,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I was torn between my \Nfeelings and my duties,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.20,0:15:04.13,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,and of course, it messed with my magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.13,0:15:05.19,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.19,0:15:07.38,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Hey, don't laugh at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.38,0:15:09.25,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,That's so rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.25,0:15:12.39,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Anyway, I got so confused, I even \Nconsidered quitting being a black witch,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.90,0:15:16.77,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,but she wasn't someone I could \Nhave that easily anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.93,0:15:22.63,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,So I decided to cast a wind spell on my \Nfeelings and scatter them to the winds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.34,0:15:26.52,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I'd scattered tons of other \Nthings to the winds by then,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.30,0:15:30.67,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,and watched all those different \Nthings as they drifted away from me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.52,0:15:43.85,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,but none of them were \Nas beautiful as that was.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.86,0:15:51.09,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Watching my feelings float away \Ndid make me kind of sad,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.09,0:15:54.97,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,but it made me realize I actually \Nhad something beautiful inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.63,0:16:00.67,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I thought I'd been scarred by \Nthe horrible things I'd witnessed,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.67,0:16:03.14,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,so I realized maybe there's \Nstill hope for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.42,0:16:08.13,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,It made me realize that all people in love\N have something pretty inside of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.57,0:16:11.57,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Suddenly, the resentment\N I'd clung to for being forced
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.57,0:16:15.16,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,into the thankless work of\N protecting people just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.57,0:16:19.89,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,So my love was gone, \Nbut in it's place I was left with
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.35,0:16:22.53,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,a little bit of a bigger heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.43,0:16:26.17,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Well, bigger than I'd had before, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.11,0:16:29.48,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Now, don't you dare
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.47,0:16:33.23,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,go around telling that story \Nto other black magicians, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.74,0:16:37.60,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.93,0:16:42.53,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I guess that means you and \NI are partners in crime now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.61,0:16:50.82,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,It's time for me to seal this love away
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.19,0:16:54.76,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,in my own way. \NIn a way that's right for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.85,0:17:00.14,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,He did pass the test, but with conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.49,0:17:02.92,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I went ahead \Nand put him to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.42,0:17:07.75,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,It seems he already knows plenty of \Nways to process the poison inside him,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.75,0:17:09.56,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,but they don't do enough yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.54,0:17:15.06,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,At Miss Luna's discretion, she must\Nextract poison from him when necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.42,0:17:20.51,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Despite the downsides, he did \Nagree fully to that condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.77,0:17:22.80,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Although I won't be nearby,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.80,0:17:27.41,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I'll keep contributing what I can \Nto help his magical powers grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.21,0:17:30.86,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I did switch sides to support him, \Nso I need to own that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.82,0:17:35.20,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,Thank you for your \Njudgment, Wind Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.20,0:17:38.28,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,I am truly glad that you \Nwere the first judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.57,0:17:41.71,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,You've got a sick sense \Nof humor, Master Bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.71,0:17:44.63,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Cold as ice. As if you have any \Nidea what I've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.06,0:17:46.79,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,Don't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.47,0:17:49.34,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.67,0:17:52.31,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.22,0:17:59.99,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,I am also very grateful that you were \Nthe one to do this, Wind Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.50,0:18:03.01,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,It's Gus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.24,0:18:08.29,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,It ain't "Wind Magician." \NMy name is Gustave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.29,0:18:12.96,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Come on, how many times do I have to \Ntell you to call me "Gus," Miss Luna?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.34,0:18:12.96,Default - Top,Luna,0,0,0,,Oh. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.96,0:18:14.94,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,G... Gu—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.94,0:18:15.97,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Wagyu?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.90,0:18:20.03,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Well, whatever. I'll be in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.68,0:18:25.17,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I'm off then. I'm still a hugely popular \Nguy with a ton of stuff on my plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.17,0:18:28.44,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,U-Um, G-Gu... Gu...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.44,0:18:29.22,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.59,0:18:30.87,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.18,0:18:32.54,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,She gave up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.22,0:18:38.19,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Miss Luna, I'll see you and Lize soon \Nenough when I get too much poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.19,0:18:39.59,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Use your shrooms on me then, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.87,0:18:44.85,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I really like those mushrooms \Nof yours, Miss Luna!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.85,0:18:46.19,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Bye-bee!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.74,0:18:51.60,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,I'll be expecting you, Gustave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.02,0:18:55.09,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,You should've said it when \Nhe was close enough to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.07,0:18:59.61,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,Oh, I think he heard her just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.94,0:19:02.73,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.30,0:19:57.15,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Please don't cry, Miss Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.67,0:19:58.99,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.38,0:20:05.18,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I'm done obsessing over things I've \Nlost and letting myself drown in grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.89,0:20:11.67,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I'll make peace with my hardship here \Nin this forest of gentle mushrooms,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.14,0:20:13.93,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,where you protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.69,0:20:19.93,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,And someday in the future, \NI know I will find love.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.21,0:20:24.01,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.01,0:20:25.74,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Um, Miss Witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.99,0:20:30.52,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,It sort of feels like my \Nclothes got bigger on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.52,0:20:32.38,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Um, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.73,0:20:41.26,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Now they fit perfectly! \NThank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.19,0:20:48.72,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,No matter how many times they're \Nerased, I still secretly remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.81,0:20:52.60,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,with the help of my faithful \Nlittle mushroom friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.01,0:20:56.17,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,my feelings for her that \NI talked about every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.98,0:21:00.98,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,My transforming little friend \Ntelepathically remembers for me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.98,0:21:06.24,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,all those beloved memories \Nthat spilled from my fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.45,0:21:15.03,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I don't care if this \Nlove is never fulfilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.73,0:21:17.69,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I will carry it with me always.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.37,0:21:21.99,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Love is the source of \Na white witch's magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.33,0:21:27.15,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I want to protect her. I want \Nto become a strong magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.53,0:21:30.82,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,To that end, this is a secret and \Nindispensable source of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.43,0:21:36.45,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,No kind of magic or turn of fate \Ncan take this away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.40,0:21:39.40,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I will accept losing some things.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.79,0:21:42.26,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,When I am worn down,\NI will strengthen my resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.14,0:21:41.99,Default - Top,Minos,0,0,0,,Hey! Over here, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.81,0:21:47.53,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I will treasure these moments, \Neven if I will eventually forget them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.31,0:21:45.46,Default - Top,Claude,0,0,0,,Outta my way, ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.17,0:21:50.14,Default - Top,Sisi,0,0,0,,Want me to hang one up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.87,0:21:51.53,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Perhaps someday, the memories that\N I've spilled will find new life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.53,0:21:54.05,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,and live on, shining within\Nsomeone else's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.58,0:21:56.67,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,The lingering echoes \Nof these quiet moments
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.67,0:22:00.47,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,and the feelings and friendships \Nthat they nurtured,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.47,0:22:02.55,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,give me the strength to continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.13,0:22:07.57,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,So no matter how many times I have \Nto start again, I will never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.33,0:22:11.71,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,While living together with\N the witch who will never find love,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.98,0:22:16.97,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I will make my way toward adulthood.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.53,0:22:30.45,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,TRANSLATION: MICHAEL ARNOLD
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.78,0:22:35.62,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,SUBTITLE TIMING: ANDY ELLIS\NEDITING: ELISABETH CRIST
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.04,0:22:40.92,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,QUALITY CHECK: GABRIELLA ALABANZA\NTRANSLATION CHECK: MICHELLE TYMON
